        <body>
            <div xml:id="d594-a1-a22">

                <pb facs="0575" n="501" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg501"/>

                <head>No. 23.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram.–Night of <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1865-02-18">the 18th of February,
                    1865</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>[To Secretary of State, Washington.]</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Eastman, American consul, Queenstown, Cork:</hi></p>
                <p>Spanish minister will not allow more work on Stonewall. The ship is wholly
                    unseaworthy. Her commander has started for Madrid. Slidell is also expected
                    here.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>PERRY.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
